### Get book report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/book/report
Accept: application/json

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/book
Accept: application/json

### Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/book/2
Accept: application/json

### Create book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "O Senhor dos Anéis",
  "author": "J. R. R. Tolkien",
  "personalCode": "GBR001",
  "edition": 1,
  "publisher": "Editora Planeta",
  "totalPages": 1212
}

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/book/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "O Senhor dos Anéis",
  "author": "J. R. R. Tolkien",
  "personalCode": "GBR001",
  "edition": 1,
  "publisher": "Editora Planeta",
  "totalPages": 1212
}


### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/book/2
